# wear/man/pattern_dots: the man's dotted cloth (two-pixel polka dots of the pattern colour, staggered: a
# print that reads at 1x, never single-pixel specks)
# GARB-M (P2b wave 2). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
legend T pattern 2
body man
role overlay dots
tags tile overlay

view D key rest origin 0 0
|TT....
|TT....
|......
|...TT.
|...TT.
|......
